  {
   "text": "The flock of Jethro went to Horeb, the mountain of God, where the desert wind had blown",
   "heard": 16,
   "words": 17,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A bush was blazing in the rocks and still it was not burned",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He turned aside to see the sight, and God called as he turned",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Moses, Moses",
   "heard": 2,
   "words": 2,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
